    "long_instructions": "## Bug Report: Inconsistent Data\r\n\r\nThe backend engineers updated how the JSON data is formatted and now our app looks buggy! Your job is to apply **defensive programming** to fix the rendering loop. Try and fix as many errors as you can.\r\n\r\n**Your Task:**\r\n- **Check for Formatting Errors:** Some artist names are in ALL CAPS and look like they are shouting.\r\n- **Resolve Data Errors:** Some 'genres' are just a single word (not an array), causing `.join()` to fail.\r\n- **Account for Missing Info:** Some artists have `null` follower data or missing images.",
